abstract: >
  Drugability Toolkit is an open-source cheminformatics workflow
  for interpretable small-molecule assessment and reproducible
  compound screening. The toolkit integrates descriptor
  calculation, drug-likeness evaluation, ADMET flag generation,
  synthetic accessibility estimation, batch compound screening,
  and reporting utilities using established cheminformatics
  methods and RDKit-based workflows.
